OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader found guilty of
OL,4,Afraud and tax evasion
OL,5,
OL,6,FAshfield District Council leader Jason
OL,7,FZadrozny has been found guilty of fraud
OL,8,Fand tax evasion.
OL,10,FZadrozny, of Stanton Hill, was accused
OL,11,Fof setting up a fake heritage group to
OL,12,Fdefraud Nottinghamshire County Council
OL,13,Fout of thousands of pounds.
OL,15,FProsecutors also alleged he failed to
OL,16,Fpay tax on four rental properties.
OL,18,FThe 46-year-old, who served as an
OL,19,FAshfield Independents councillor on the
OL,20,Fcounty council, was found guilty of
OL,21,Fnine counts of fraud and four counts of
OL,22,Ftax evasion.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
